# Uranium · U · gate 92

**Uranium** (U) is element **92** of the periodic table — a **actinide**, period 7, group f-block, f-block, solid at standard conditions, atomic weight **238.03**.

## The element (carbon layer — reference chemistry)
The fuel of the reactor and the first atomic bomb; the heaviest element born in the Earth itself.

